c. Develop a JSP application to display data from a MySQL Database using JDBC.
CODE:-
Sql code :
CREATE DATABASE ecommerce;
USE ecommerce;
Database changed
 CREATE TABLE product (
         product_id INT PRIMARY KEY,
        product_name VARCHAR(100),
        category VARCHAR(50),
       brand VARCHAR(50),
       price DECIMAL(10,2),
